{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_halo2_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_halo2_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "谢拉格假期",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_halo2_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d13faae51860efb1a5b10d66f1273cad9b7eed7714b762ddad87b69a78f47f4b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "又过零点了，唉......得抓紧给关于耶拉冈德的报告收尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "没想到居然有一天，“巨兽”这种字眼会出现在我的文章里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "嗯......那是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "啊，缪尔赛思主任，您怎么来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "埃琳娜！我就知道，这个点了还在这里的多半是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "你回观测站后，写各种报告都快写一个月啦，不用把自己逼得那么紧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "整理数据就花了好久，还要尝试在实验室里复现一些体验，我才能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "好啦好啦，科学又不会因为你少干两天，就自己退步的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "说起来，明天开始，就是观测站给研究员们安排的假期了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "我记得你申请了留在谢拉格？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "你不会——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "别这么看着我啦，主任！我知道您的意思，我不会偷偷加班的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "在天灾前，我一直留在观测站，几乎没有出过门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "天灾后不久倒是下去逛了一圈，但您也知道，那趟路途可有点......不太轻松。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "这倒是，嘿嘿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "所以我才想在这次假期，好好看看谢拉格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "那我就放心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "我过来也是想提醒你一下，选择留在谢拉格度假的研究员，在假期第一天都会有本地志愿者来当导游，帮助你们熟悉环境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "可别忘了，明天一早你的志愿者就会过来等你，所以现在就去休息吧，别起不来耽搁了行程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "好......但应该还差最后几百字，我马上就能完成！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "唉，算了，拗不过你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "明天好好玩吧，埃琳娜，别忘了去吃一顿奶酪锅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "那当然，这回说什么也要吃上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "怎么？认不出来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年轻的猎人拍着身上的雪花，在她左肩趴着的裂云兽冲埃琳娜兴奋地叫着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "（小声）没事的裂云兽，埃琳娜虽然有点笨，但她不至于几天就把我们忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我都听到了！茱安娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......算了。昨天主任告诉我，第一天会有本地志愿者陪同熟悉环境，难道你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "嗯，我就是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "前些天你们的人到处贴单子招志愿者，我去接弟弟妹妹的时候看到了，就报了名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "招志愿者的那个姐姐对我特别满意，说她一眼就能看出来，我绝对是“最本地人”的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你这打扮确实很难说不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "嗯......那，我们要不要先去找恩雅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "恩雅她可是圣女大人，平时不能到处走动的，何况现在她肯定要留在蔓珠院处理事情——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "啊，你是不是不相信我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "不不，倒没有不相信那么夸张......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "那不就完事了，直接说你想去哪儿玩，我带你去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......我想想啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "现在走到山下也快中午了，我连早餐都还没吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你有什么推荐的、奶酪锅做得比较好的餐厅吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "奶酪锅？什么奶酪锅啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "什么？你连奶酪锅都不知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你还是谢拉格人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我不是，难道你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "奶酪锅谁不知道，但那是城里人才爱吃的鬼东西，哪比得上我家的烤肉和熏肠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "但哥伦比亚出的旅游指南里，都把奶酪锅排进各国美食必吃榜前十了啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你们哥伦比亚人哪懂什么好吃，谢拉格最好吃的，就得数山上的野味了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "那你的意思是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "现在打猎肯定是来不及了，我家里的储备也不太够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "住山上的猎户，多少都储备了点野味，我们现在过去找他们，正好能蹭上午饭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "大家都是热情虔诚的好人，别担心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我的奶酪锅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "哎呀，奶酪锅什么时候不能吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我们晚上再去城里，现在先跟我来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......答应我走慢一点，我就跟你去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "终于到山脚了，埃琳娜，快看我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我不是来陪你打雪仗的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你在想什么呢？谢拉格的传统，就是拿雪抹在额头，祈祷耶拉冈德保佑我们平安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "可你那个动作是抹吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "是那个意思就行了，我们谢拉格人都不爱搞那些繁文缛节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你别蒙我，难道藏经阁里那么多书就没有讲礼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "啊！右边额头还没抹上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "茱安娜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "嘿嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你别跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "呜哇哇哇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "抓紧了，埃琳娜，从雪橇上摔出去了我可不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你说的保佑我们平安，就是我们两个人一起挤一个破木头雪橇在林地里乱冲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "裂云兽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（咕噜咕噜）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "外加一只裂云兽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "什么破木头？好多人想坐谢拉格的雪橇都坐不着呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我再提个速，你别着急，过会儿就爽快了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "呜哇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "灾厄之后，难得有这种好天气，裂云兽也开心多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "裂云兽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（咕噜咕噜）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......嗯？埃琳娜？你怎么还没跟上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你可......蹿得比，羽兽飞得还快，我怎么，能......咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "这才哪到哪啊？我们可是一起上过圣山的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "那是人......恩，恩雅会时不时等一下我，你呢！咳咳咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我是去吃饭的，又不是来徒步的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "那，你多坐一会儿，我等你还不行吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "咳，所以，我们还，还要走多久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "马上了马上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "翻过这个山头，再爬个半小时，就能看到人烟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "呜哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "裂云兽像曾经在圣山那样，攀到了埃琳娜的肩头。\n但它不知道，这会是“压垮”一名科学家的最后一根稻草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "啊......裂，裂，裂云兽——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "茱安娜和她的小宠物愣在原地，面面相觑。埃琳娜就这么倒在了他们面前，已经没有了反应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你，你你你闯祸了！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你把莱茵生命的研究员害死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "裂云兽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（咕噜咕噜）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你说......你说得对！埃琳娜不会死的，再大的困难我们也挺过来了，她可是面见过耶拉冈德的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "埃琳娜！你还好吗？你可千万不要死啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你要是死了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "她动了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "咳，咳呜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "流了好多冷汗，咳出来的都是沫子，嘴唇也青紫了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "怎么办怎么办......哥伦比亚人的身体怎么这么弱，我从来没见谢拉格人出过这种情况......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......不行，我这就去找人救你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她蹲下身子，拽住埃琳娜的衣服猛地一提，将埃琳娜扛在肩上，两边臂弯箍紧埃琳娜的手脚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "嘿——嘿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "埃琳娜，坚持住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你这么扛着我跑，不如直接给我一箭，或许还快一点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "咳——真的要死了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "用尽全力说出这些话后，她闭上了眼睛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“好了，吉妮，我知道你喜欢听爸爸讲星星的故事，但现在也该睡觉了。”\n“嗯？你想去野外看星星？现在你还太小了，等你长大一点，我们一起去最高的山上，看遍所有的星星，好不好？”\n“别这样，这次爸爸妈妈绝对不骗人。总有一天，你会伴着漫天星辰，微笑入睡。”\n“毕竟，你的名字，是‘群星的源头’......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "她醒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我这是在哪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "埃琳娜，你在山上的诊所，是这位医生救了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......谢......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "言重了，汤剂只能缓解症状，你需要多多休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "医生，她这是什么病啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "谢拉格的山太高了，很多外国人都不适应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "一般情况下或许还能忍受，但埃琳娜小姐过来的时候，显然是运动过度、体能枯竭，所以症状严重了些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我给你赔不是！裂云兽，我们一起给埃琳娜道歉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "裂云兽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（咕噜咕噜）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "好好好，我知道你是好心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "容我先起个身——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "翻下病床时，埃琳娜不禁趔趄，茱安娜迅速扑向她的手边，把她扶起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "耶拉冈德在上，你可别乱动了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我没事啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "不必过度担心她，她会很快恢复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......多亏了您在山上还开有诊所，我差点以为自己要交待在雪山上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "这座山上猎户多，他们下山不方便，就向蔓珠院请求派个医生过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "正好我在藏经阁学习如何行医治病，阿德颂长老把我安排到这里，这一待就是十来年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "不过，这几年喀兰贸易在城里建了医院，大家宁可麻烦点也要进城看病，我这里也就清闲多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "医生，那我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "啊，米娅，我忙得忘了你的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "前几天又换了种胃药，对你有效果吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "text": "完全没有，我的肚子还是很疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "这不应该啊，你去城里看过没？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "text": "我这不是信不过城里人吗......他们用的那些化学方子，好多人吃完，反倒生出其他毛病来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "唉，你先坐，我翻翻书，再想想办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......也许，我能帮得上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我随身携带的仪器里，有一个超声成像的设备，之前有人试过，勉强能做一些器官检查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "text": "可，这不还是城里人的方法吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "那有什么的？你用用也不亏嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "text": "不不......我第一次见这种东西，还是算了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "埃琳娜，我们一起劝劝她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "埃琳娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我的意思是，这不是什么城里人的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "这可是祂赐福过的法器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "话音刚落，连她自己也震惊了——这分明是她曾经最为厌恶的神秘学才会使用的说辞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "text": "你说的是......耶拉冈德？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我曾经和圣女同行，正是使用这个仪器，才让我能一睹祂的真容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "众所周知，祂从不轻易显圣。由此可见，这个仪器能够感知到祂，自然是得到了祂的首肯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她把目光挪向一旁的猎手，挤了挤眉毛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......她说得没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我和她都是圣女大人的侍从，圣女大人求见耶拉冈德时，我们自然也都在场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "对对对，圣女大人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "text": "确实有听人说过，圣女大人回来时，有两名侍从一直跟着她，其中一名还是外来者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "text": "那么......你们在哪里见到的祂？祂又对你们说了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "祂说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "（压低声音）祂说什么来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "“不要求于我的殿，而要求于我的心。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我们在祂......在这片大地的神秘面前，都是懵懂无知的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "如果没有向违逆自己常识的禁地踏足的勇气，那才是真正的愚昧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "text": "我明白了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "text": "这位小姐，我该如何配合？我，相信你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "请将外套取下，我去准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "呼......谢谢，谢谢。多亏了你，我才知道，原来她是胆部生了结石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "不过，尽管她接受了我的检查，可她还是不愿去医院里治疗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "等米娅下次过来拿药的时候，我再劝劝她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "这不是药物能够轻易治疗的病症，我有点后悔刚才没有尽力劝说她了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "......米娅是个聪明人，她未必真相信那套“法器”的说辞，但为了确诊还是同意了检查，这已经是现在的她能接受的极限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "人越是聪明，越容易执着于自己的想法。所以这些人心中的成见，可比一般人根深蒂固得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "如果不切身去体验实情，谁又能摆脱得了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......您经历过很多类似的事情吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "是啊，我曾经也不喜欢喀兰贸易带来的新玩意，但真正见识过它们的用处，就像今天这样，也不得不服气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "现在呢，得反过来，不少人倒是对我有成见了，觉得所有老的、过去的东西都是骗人的，我也无可奈何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "或许有一天，他们也能体会到这些老东西的好处，顺便体会到自己的狭隘吧，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "好了，我得替米娅感谢你们，马上就天黑了，不妨留下来吃个晚饭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "等等，晚饭？都有什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_268",
      "text": "嗯......我这里除了些蔬菜，还剩下两条熏肠——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "好耶！你听见了吗埃琳娜，我们有口福了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "埃琳娜吃过晚饭，在诊所外散着步，耳边隐约还能听见茱安娜与医生吃喝聊天的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "这是......谢拉格的星空......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她搓了搓手，刚呵出的一阵白汽，霎时被山风揉进了夜色，她缓步走向前方，向着几乎能触碰到的星空走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "告诉你个好消息，刚才我软磨硬泡，医生终于同意我把剩下那半条熏肠也烤了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "一会儿再去吃点，然后我再送你回观测站，吃不完的也都给你捎上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "埃琳娜？是不是又不舒服了？怎么不说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......啊，别担心，我在想些事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "事情？关于这天空吗？你好像一直在盯着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "嗯......这是我第一次不借助任何设备，看到如此清晰的星空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我从小看到大，也没觉得有什么稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "茱安娜，其实，我们乌比卡家族是研究星象学的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "如今我和父母都闹得很僵，但在小时候他们经常会带着我，用望远镜去看星星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "可我晚上自己拉开窗帘，肉眼看到的星星却是那么黯淡，问父母时，他们也说不出道理，只是告诉我城市里不如野外、山上看得清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "而这个问题，像枚种子种在我的内心，我恼恨自己的愚蠢，得不到任何答案......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "直到大了一些，我在图书馆里，知道了“大气湍流”“光污染”这些词，我才恍然大悟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......我不懂那些星星的知识，但我觉得有时候愚蠢点也是好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "就像这件事，你要是不觉得自己愚蠢，或许永远都不会在图书馆里翻找答案了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你说得很对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "埃琳娜，你的父母有和你说过，他们为什么喜欢看星星吗？就是那个什么星象学？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "喜欢？家族传承有什么喜不喜欢的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我们家打猎和雕刻也是传承，但我觉得如果不喜欢，我的先祖们也不会坚持那么久吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......我想起来了，母亲告诉我，先祖们曾说过一句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "“美与未知。”美让人们注视着未知，而未知则令人感到更深邃的美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "或许这就是他们最初仰望星空的原因......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "呃......有点难懂，听上去就像修士们念叨《耶拉冈德》，应该不是坏话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "聊了那么久，也该下山了，我去给你把烤肠包上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......谢谢你，茱安娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "本地研究员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2000_1",
      "text": "嘿，埃琳娜，今天玩得开心吗？你比其他人回来得都晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "最后倒确实开心了，但中间也有些曲折，嘿嘿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "本地研究员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2000_1",
      "text": "刚才接待员和我说，今天有一个客人来找你，说之前寄了信迟迟没有收到回复，说什么今天也要见你一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "本地研究员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2000_1",
      "text": "你去接待室看一看吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "客人？找我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我现在就去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "本地研究员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2000_1",
      "text": "等一下，这个味道是......野味熏肠？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "你也爱吃这个吗？今天我的导游朋友说，你们谢拉格本地人都觉得它比奶酪锅好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "本地研究员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2000_1",
      "text": "啊，那可能是习俗不同吧。小时候家里穷，吃一餐熏肠要高兴好久，但现在嘛，还是觉得奶酪锅好吃点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "本地研究员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2000_1",
      "text": "所以埃琳娜......能给我留一份吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "原来如此......我还不饿，见客人要紧，你想吃的话先吃吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......我就知道，一定是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "吉妮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "你没事，真是太好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "天灾之后，我就一直往这里寄信，想知道你的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "可没过多久，又听说谢拉格和维多利亚打了一仗，心里难免更加紧张......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "嗯嗯......前段时间境外寄进来的信件也都被暂时扣留了，最近才准备逐渐发放。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "那你有受伤吗？有生病吗？最近都还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我......最近发生了很多事，或许我也改变了一些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "但我很好，最近发生在我身上的一切都很好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "让你担心了，姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "那就好......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "我从哥伦比亚带了你最喜欢的咖啡豆，和我们在特里蒙常去的那家早餐店用的是一种。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "啊，还带了一个手摇磨豆机。虽然现在有点晚了，但如果你想喝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "想！我来谢拉格之后，很久没喝过好咖啡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "哼哼，那你等我一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "不过说起来，你是从哥伦比亚来的吗？平时你应该留在罗德岛吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "最近罗德岛也发生了好多事，我们后面找时间慢慢聊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "总之，在罗德岛出事之后我回了一趟家。谢拉格发生天灾的时候，母亲她也病倒了，我也就多留了几天，和父亲轮流照顾她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "当时我试着告诉他们你在谢拉格的事情，可刚说了几句，父亲的脸色就沉了下来，咬着牙和我说不要提你的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我就知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "然后那几天，父亲他刻意背着我，偷偷买了好几份不同的报纸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "可他不是不爱看报吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "因为，那时候的报纸上都是谢拉格的新闻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "他拿着报纸去找母亲，一边翻一边说着话......讲完后，他们拥抱了好一会儿，父亲才红着眼睛走出房间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "或许是年纪大了......吉妮，其实他和母亲都很想了解你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "姐姐，你知道我......他们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "我不是替他们当说客的，吉妮。你知道我是和你站在一起的，我也知道他们对你都干了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "不过，如果有那么一天，他们向我打听你的消息，我还是想告诉他们，可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "母亲她......还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "母亲只是得了比较严重的感冒，我走之前她就已经痊愈了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "她可决不接受自己病恹恹的模样，退烧的第一天就又板起了那个老石头雕塑似的脸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "哼......听你这么说，我反而放心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "姐姐，你平时随身带着的星象学笔记还在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "嗯。怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......我想看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "可是你对星象学那一套，不是很反感吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我......研究谢拉格天灾的真相的时候，见到了谢拉格人口中的“神明”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "一开始，我觉得“神明”只是奇谈怪论，为与我同行的人相信“神明”存在而感到苦恼，明明源石矿脉才是最符合理性的解释。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "直到我走进那个洞穴......无论多么不愿相信，仪器上都传来了生物讯号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "当脑子里连“巨兽”这种词都浮出来后，我突然意识到，自己从事的那些研究，或许，也和家传的星象学没有很大的差别......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "那个无可救药的混蛋，乌比卡先生，父亲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我多少体会到他的想法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "吉妮，你不必否定自己的道路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "不，不是的，姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我揭开了隐秘真相的一角，绝不会就在这里停留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "我依然相信，科学是探索未知最好的工具，也是我必须要自己走的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "先祖们或许走在一条错误的道路上，可他们的研究并非毫无价值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "只不过......他们没来得及见到谢拉格的星空，所以该轮到我们去继续这段未竟的探索了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星极",
      "speakerId": "avg_274_Astesia_1",
      "text": "吉妮，去做你想做的事，我会永远支持你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "怎么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你怎么一副很惊讶的样子？我不能来啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "......主任和我说，本地志愿者只陪同第一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我想来招待下我的外地朋友，没必要按他们的规矩来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你说呢？裂云兽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "裂云兽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（咕噜咕噜）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "好像也确实是这个道理......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "那，你今天得答应我两个条件，我才能跟你走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我直接答应了，你说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "第一，不要再在雪山上乱跑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "第二......我们这就下山，去吃奶酪锅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我不是说了那玩意——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_1047_halo2_1",
      "text": "不行，我必须亲自吃到，才知道好不好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "唉，真拿你没办法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我们出发吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
